  "description": "Roon 24\" 26\" Fat Tire Bike\n\nWide Tire - Adapts to a variety of terrains for a smooth and easy ride.\nDual Disc Brakes - Fully ensure your child's safety.\n\nShimano Drivetrain & Revoshift Shifter - Easy handling, which helps children and beginners learn the gears easily.\n\nDurable and Comfortable\n\nHiland frames are made from hi-ten steel with strong support strength, allows for bumping absorption and a smooth ride on mountain roads, forest paths and snowfield.\n\nErgonomic and adjustable seat makes the trip easier. Soft seat and sturdy frame can adapt to various road, has a good shock absorption effect, effectively resists the impact on the body.\n\nWide Tire\n\nThe 20*4.0-inch tires run with very low air pressure, make for a great ride experience on mountain roads, highways, and forest ways.\n\nIt provide upgraded grip and traction on rough roads. These fat tires keep you safe and give you a smooth and easy ride even in the most challenging terrain and weather conditions.\n\nDouble Disc Double Safe\n\nDisc brakes allow for more precise and controlled , are more effective than rim brakes, help to keep safer when riding at high speeds, down slopes and in wet conditions.\n\nHiland kids fat tire bikes feature a dual mechanical disc, which ensure that the child can stop immediately in case of emergency.\n\nProfessional Drivetrain\n\nSHIMANO TY300D rear derailleur and MICROSHIFT MS25 grip shifter to ease kids into how to use gears.\n\nIt provide 7 speed gears for your little ones to make it up and down almost anything.\n\nAssembly & Guide\n\n85% pre-assembled, assembly tools included, easy to assemble within 25 minutes. Click on the video to see an instructional video on assembly.\n\nSolutions will be quickly provided by support team within 24 hours! Bikes all have been inspected before package. Solve all your worries!\n\n\"Conquer snow, sand, and trails with the Hiland Roon 26 Fat Tire Bike. Features a durable high-carbon steel frame, 4-inch wide tires, Shimano 7-speed shifting, and dual disc brakes. Perfect for teens and adults seeking all-terrain adventure. Shop now!\"",
